!src
!kasm-desktop-kde
# Transient: the Nix KasmVNC closure staged by the resolute finish build
# (dockerfile-nix-ubuntu-resolute); absent in normal builds.
!nix-closure

# Strip Go build artefacts so a developer's local `make` doesn't
# inflate the build context or leak host-built binaries into the
# kasmgo_builder stage.
src/common/kasm-go/bin

